SITE_DESCRIPTION=FloppyDisk.link is a personal project by me, [Greg Tatum](https://gregtatum.com/). It is a collection of tools that work on files. These files are stored either on your machine via the browser, on a locally hosted server, or via a third party service, such as Dropbox.
